@startuml Push Notification - Sequence Diagram
!theme plain
title Push Notification (FCM)
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE

participant "Flutter App" as F
participant "Backend API" as B
database "Database" as DB
participant "Firebase FCM" as FCM

== Device Registration ==
F -> F : App start → getToken()
F -> B : POST /api/notifications/devices/register\n{fcmToken, deviceType}
B -> DB : UPSERT user_devices

== Send Notification ==
B -> DB : SELECT user_devices WHERE user_id
B -> FCM : sendEachForMulticast(tokens, {title, body, data})
FCM --> B : results
B -> DB : Cleanup invalid tokens

note over B,FCM
  **Notif Types:**
  - NEW_ORDER → Provider
  - ORDER_ACCEPTED/REJECTED → Customer
  - ON_THE_WAY/ARRIVED/IN_PROGRESS/COMPLETED → Customer
  - PAYMENT_CONFIRMED → Customer
  - NEW_CUSTOM_TASK → Providers
  - CUSTOM_TASK_ACCEPTED → Customer
  - PROVIDER_VERIFIED/REJECTED → Provider
  - NEW_REVIEW → Provider
end note

== Flutter Handles Tap ==
F -> F : onMessageOpenedApp
F -> F : Parse data.type → Navigate

@enduml
